        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy brings <strong>four fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed—simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> – Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> – Help a little frog learn the alphabet, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> – Practice numbers,  addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIEW AND RUN</strong> - Test your accumulated knowledge of each difficulty while running away from imminent danger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Review and Run does not have a practice mode since it takes the subjects from all the other games!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy brings <strong>four fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed—simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> – Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> – Help a little frog learn the alphabet, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> – Practice numbers,  addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REVIEW AND RUN</strong> - Test your accumulated knowledge of each difficulty while running away from imminent danger!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Review and Run does not have a practice mode since it takes the subjects from all the other games!</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>",
        "short_description": "LEARNMOOR: Kids Academy brings four fun and educational games for kids from preschool to 1st grade! Play exciting mini-games, practice key skills like math and reading, unlock secret characters, and watch your child learn while having a blast!",
